CORE
main.c
--program-only
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
mutable_table#\d+\[\[5\]\]
--
^warning: ignoring
[ (]table#\d+\[\[[0-9]+\]\]
--
The const table is assigned as a whole (no table#N[[k]] symbols, unlike
the mutable one), and the read table[2] is propagated, so that the first
assertion's condition does not mention the table.
